{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2022-07-20 11:00:00', 'title': 'FIELD TRIAL SUCCESS DRIVES ADVANCEMENT IN ASIAN SOYBEAN RUST RESISTANCE', 'text': '2BLADES AND CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE REACH COLLABORATION MILESTONE IN DEVELOPMENT OF DURABLE RESISTANCE FOR LATIN AMERICAN SOYBEAN VARIETIES EVANSTON, ILL., AND INDIANAPOLIS , JULY 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, 2BLADES AND CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE REACHED A MILESTONE IN THEIR COLLABORATION TO DEVELOP A TRANSGENE FOR ASIAN SOYBEAN RUST (ASR) RESISTANCE WITH SUCCESSFUL FIELD TRIALS OF LATIN AMERICAN SOYBEAN VARIETIES CONTAINING THE NEW ASR TRANSGENE.'}